    "result_text": "The test passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the \"narrow the all-invoices list to a single stage\" filter as a full-stack, additive change. The `status` column and its index already existed (V5/V7/V11), so no migration was needed.\n\n**Server** (mirrors the existing `sort` pattern):\n- `InvoiceRepository.java` \u2014 added `findByStatusOrderByIdAsc(String)`, keeping the stable oldest-first order so filtering only narrows, never reorders.\n- `InvoicesAllGet.java` \u2014 added an optional `@HttpQueryParameter(\"status\")`; when present it returns only invoices at that stage, otherwise the full list.\n\n**Front-end** (three-things-only sharing: a query key, a URL param, a slot id):\n- `slots/defs/allInvoicesToolbar.ts` \u2014 new toolbar region above the all-invoices list.\n- `features/invoices/statusFilter.slot.tsx` \u2014 a self-contained `<select data-testid=\"invoice-status-filter\">` that owns the `invoiceStatus` URL search param (DRAFT/SENT/PAID + an \"All stages\" clear option).\n- `features/invoices/AllInvoicesPage.tsx` \u2014 reads the same `invoiceStatus` key, folds it into the `['invoices','all',status]` query key + request, and renders `<AllInvoicesToolbar.Slot />`. The key still starts with `'invoices'`, so writes that invalidate `['invoices']` refresh it too.\n\nVerification: `npm run typecheck` clean, and `bin/e2e` passes (3 rows \u2192 2 after selecting SENT, with rows 1 & 3 visible and row 2 gone).",
